	"content_rules": [
		"Every session must cover the phases assigned to it, in order. When phases are grouped, cover them in one session without skipping any.",
		"Engage must activate prior knowledge with a question, phenomenon or scenario; Explore is hands-on before the explanation; Explain gives the formal vocabulary and concepts; Elaborate applies the idea to a new context; Evaluate checks the understanding.",
		"Do not invent standards, curriculum codes or textbook references."
